B.Ui=new A.aV('Why are deep learning models called "black boxes"?',B.LM,1,'The passage states their "decision-making processes are opaque even to their creators."')
B.K6=s(["It is unnecessary","It could stifle innovation","AI is always fair","Regulation is too expensive"],t.s)
B.UK=new A.aV("What is the main argument against AI regulation?",B.K6,1,'Critics "contend that excessive regulation could stifle innovation and put countries at a competitive disadvantage."')
