B.Ud=new A.aV("How has teletherapy helped mental health care?",B.Me,1,'Teletherapy "has dramatically expanded access to mental health services, particularly for those in rural areas."')
B.Pa=s(["Technology is always harmful","Technology is always beneficial","It depends on how we use it","Only young people are affected"],t.s)
B.Uo=new A.aV("What do experts say about technology and mental health?",B.Pa,2,'"Technology itself is neither inherently harmful nor beneficial\u2014what matters is how we use it."')
