B.P1=s(["People live longer","Automation and AI transform job markets","Universities require it","It is cheaper"],t.s)
B.Uf=new A.aV("Why is lifelong learning becoming necessary?",B.P1,1,'"As automation and AI transform job markets, workers will need to continuously update their skills."')
